# This package SHIPS the derived corpus (data/) and the expected outputs (reproduce_out/)
# so `python reproduce.py` runs offline with no model and no network. They are part of
# the deposit. `make data` (optional) rebuilds the full-text corpus from the link lists.

# Local config (copy from example.env) and the local-only fetch symlink:
.env
data_link

# Non-redistributable abstracts (rebuilt locally by src/fetch_restricted.py from
# data/restricted.csv; sha256-verified against the frozen bytes) and regenerable
# artifacts that embed abstract text:
data/md/kalman-epidemic-001.md
data/md/hawkes-crime-001.md
data/md/gp-geo-noname-001.md
data/md/pca-psychometrics-001.md
data/md/smoke-01.md
datasets/validity/wild_3arm_pairs.json
reproduce_out/inspect_top10.txt

# Python:
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.venv/
